                      "name": "Note title",
                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "NOTE · NEXT STEP IS NEVER EMPTY",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": 0.6
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rKyQB",
                      "name": "Note body",
                      "fill": "$text",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Four statuses share status-neutral-2: Finance Approved, Approved, Return to Admin, Maker Done. In the PG-04 list row they are only distinguishable by the next-step column. Therefore the next-step field must never be empty. Return to Admin has no Requester action; its next step reads as waiting on Admin, which is what separates it from Maker Done and Approved. Status colour is supplementary; next-step text carries the difference.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
